# CODEOWNERS
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Order matters: the LAST matching pattern for a changed file wins.

# Default owner for the whole repo. This protects everything outside proto,
# AND gates newly-added top-level proto packages: a new package under proto/
# that is not listed below falls through to this rule, so the Motif Data
# Management team must review it — that review is where a new top-level
# package's name gets approved.
* @motif-io/motif-data-management

# --- Approved proto packages ---------------------------------------------
# When the Motif team approves a new package's name, add a line here
# assigning the package to its owner(s) so they own ongoing edits.
#
# Owners can be:
#   - a team IN the motif-io org (must have write access):
#       /proto/<package>/   @motif-io/<owning-team>
#   - a list of individuals (space/comma-separated; each must have write
#     access — external contributors added as outside collaborators):
#       /proto/<package>/   @alice @bob
#
# NOTE: an owner CANNOT be a team from a different GitHub org — teams must
# belong to motif-io. Cross-org contributors must be listed as individuals.

# The motif package is owned by the Motif team. Subpackages default to this
# ownership. Order matters - list more specific ownership below this line.
/proto/motif/ @motif-io/motif

# API, Events, and Extension packages are owned by the Motif Data Management team.
/proto/motif/api/       @motif-io/motif-data-management
/proto/motif/events/    @motif-io/motif-data-management
/proto/motif/extension/ @motif-io/motif-data-management

# Data packages owned by the Motif Data Management team.
/proto/motif/data/document/ @motif-io/motif-data-management
/proto/motif/data/project/  @motif-io/motif-data-management

# The FDE package is owned by the Motif FDE team.
/proto/motif/data/fde/ @motif-io/motif-fde

# The AI package is owned by the Motif AI Extensibility team.
/proto/motif/data/ai/ @motif-io/motif-ai-extensibility

# Partner / third-party packages. Ownership defaults to the FDE team.
# Specific subpackages can be assigned third party owners that are
# added as outside collaborators. Order matters - list more specific
# third party package ownership below this line.
/proto/thirdparty/ @motif-io/motif-fde
